            "name": "12 Labours of Hercules III: Girl Power",
            "steam_appid": 360650,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Our latest games!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Steam group to learn more about our games, events and giveaways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/c366cc4f069c6c372840f50d6884be00.avif?t=1789036654\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules is battling the monstrous Scylla when Charybdis strikes from the shadows - capturing his loyal companion Cerberus, then vanishing with Hercules himself. In this fast-paced time management adventure, only one person can bring him back: his wife, Megara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/e8af75d04d99dd9b3a4791790f728778.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megara sets out to track him down and set him free. Once Hercules is back at her side, the two continue the journey together, through the forest of the Amazons and up the slopes of Mount Olympus, rebuilding roads and clearing obstacles every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/05b76260142984db3243721e07d01f1e.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Megara reach Hercules before Charybdis's trap closes for good? Play 12 Labours of Hercules III: Girl Power and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/b251bb3a9ac8f2a227de8645d6cc7b88.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Megara, Hercules' wife, in a story built around her</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful comic-panel storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pieces of numerous puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat gold time and build the great castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning HD visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-style storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player adventures</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/c366cc4f069c6c372840f50d6884be00.avif?t=1789036654\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules is battling the monstrous Scylla when Charybdis strikes from the shadows - capturing his loyal companion Cerberus, then vanishing with Hercules himself. In this fast-paced time management adventure, only one person can bring him back: his wife, Megara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/e8af75d04d99dd9b3a4791790f728778.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Megara sets out to track him down and set him free. Once Hercules is back at her side, the two continue the journey together, through the forest of the Amazons and up the slopes of Mount Olympus, rebuilding roads and clearing obstacles every step of the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/05b76260142984db3243721e07d01f1e.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Megara reach Hercules before Charybdis's trap closes for good? Play 12 Labours of Hercules III: Girl Power and find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/360650/extras/b251bb3a9ac8f2a227de8645d6cc7b88.avif?t=1789036654\" width=614 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced time management gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Megara, Hercules' wife, in a story built around her</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful comic-panel storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pieces of numerous puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat gold time and build the great castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning HD visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Points Shop items available</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comic-style storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player adventures</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Help Megara free the hero and then accompany him in all of his adventures, including the forest of the Amazons and Mount Olympus in 12 Labours of Hercules III: Girl Power!",
